Subject: [PATCH 25/32] =?UTF-8?q?BlueOS:=20SystemUI:=200.7.2=20fixes=20fro?=
 =?UTF-8?q?m=20the=20phone=20=E2=80=94=20solid=20player=20card,=20bold=20g?=
 =?UTF-8?q?reeting,=20lock=20text=20colour=20by=20the=20theme?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Player without a cover: a solid Monet card (the player is drawn over black: a see-through card came out grey or
black, with or without a blur — measured), the app icon in the card's text colour. Greeting «like the Summary»:
BOLD as a style (BlueOS's fonts have one weight, 600 did nothing); the date row keeps its weight, the weather in
the clock's colour. A new palette re-colours «Сэнсэй» and the weather (they kept the old accent).
«Цвет текста на блокировке» (blueos_lock_text_color): by the theme (default — the dark theme keeps the clock,
halo, greeting and date light) or by the wallpaper under the clock (0.5–0.7.1). The halo takes the colour the
digits are really drawn with (they kept the AOD colour, the halo took the lock screen's).

Change-Id: I098cf7d31c683019b7dd799a9e000db195c20245
